# Source material containing personal data; never commit.
# reference/ holds an Outlook mailbox export (the PI's full inbox) and WSPRSonde
# host shipping lists with home addresses, phone numbers and email addresses.
# Facts extracted from these belong in data/ and docs/ with the personal data
# stripped; the originals stay local. See "Data handling" in CLAUDE.md.
reference/
